{
  "name": "net_statehash_enemy_negative",
  "description": "Targeted objectId311 native enemy negative control: set only one matched client actor HP-lock bit, kill its host counterpart natively, require FAILED client death with actual surviving HP, two same-epoch unequal native enemy hashes and relay DesyncEnemies; preserve strict unaffected-peer parity, restore only the original bit then host reload and parity. Prior object309 attempt exposed unrelated client2 unmatched-refill divergence and remains failed evidence.",
